{
  "indexVersion": 1,
  "contracts": {
    "projectModel": "docs/contracts/project-model.md (packet 20, §§10.5–10.8, 12, 13.1, 18–22)"
  },
  "notes": [
    "Packet 20 model fixtures, written as schemaVersion 2 documents. Phase 9.3 removed the v2 scene model: the fixtures now pin the same scene/content/project rules in the live v3 validators (packages/project-model/src/m2-rules-v3.test.ts). The test upgrades each document in memory — scene schemaVersion 2 -> 3, content gains \"game\": null — and nothing else; the v1 -> v2 migration fixtures were archived with the migration (archive/removed-v1-v2/fixtures-m2-model-migration/).",
    "Dispatch: kind scene-v2 -> validateSceneV3/parseSceneV3; content -> validateContentV3; project-v2 -> validateProjectV3 (the file is {manifest, scene, content}).",
    "Valid entries must round-trip byte-exactly: parse -> normalize -> serializeCanonical -> parse must be byte-identical and idempotent, and the canonical bytes must equal the committed file bytes after the same in-memory upgrade.",
    "Invalid entries must fail non-destructively: the exact error-code set is pinned; the source bytes must be retained unchanged by the pure validators.",
    "valid/project-v2.json embeds copies of valid/scene-v2.json and valid/content.json; the test asserts they deep-equal, so the composition fixture cannot drift."
  ],
  "entries": [
    {
      "path": "valid/scene-v2.json",
      "kind": "scene-v2",
      "entryPoint": "validateSceneV3",
      "valid": true,
      "expectedNormalized": "valid/scene-v2.json",
      "notes": "SchemaVersion 2 scene exercising every v2 component: camera, group, model+behavior values, box collider, polygon collider, controller, prefab provenance. Canonical (byte-exact) already."
    },
    {
      "path": "valid/content.json",
      "kind": "content",
      "entryPoint": "validateContentV3",
      "valid": true,
      "expectedNormalized": "valid/content.json",
      "notes": "Content catalog with two asset versions, one prefab definition, one declaration-only behavior (source null) covering number/boolean/string/enum/vec3/entityRef/assetRef, the six settings keys and an empty behaviorTrust."
    },
    {
      "path": "valid/project-v2.json",
      "kind": "project-v2",
      "entryPoint": "validateProjectV3",
      "valid": true,
      "notes": "Three-block composition: manifest v1 + embedded scene v2 + content. Cross-block references all resolve; the embedded scene/content must deep-equal the standalone fixtures."
    },
